<title>NORWAY: Norway N.Sea oil output normal, Gullfaks loading.</title>
<headline>Norway N.Sea oil output normal, Gullfaks loading.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>One shuttle tanker was loading at the North Sea Gullfaks oilfield on Wednesday, but bad weather continued to disrupt operations at the Statfjord development, operator Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said.</p>
<p>All production remained normal, Statoil spokeswoman Nina Steihaug told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;There are three vessels waiting at the fields and they hope to start loading around midnight,&quot; Steihaug said.</p>
<p>&quot;But we have been able to load a lot of crude (in the past 24 hours) so we're not seeing any production problems and we're not too dependent on the weather for a while.&quot;</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
